_paragraph\" >It\u2019s more than just a game; it\u2019s a subtle way to stay active. Best of all, you\u2019ll forget you\u2019re even moving as you get immersed in the addictive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch between the camera view and the stickman view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254630/extras/72b1fa16dc8dcff491505e987b58dc1d.poster.avif?t=1729869386\" width=600 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254630/extras/72b1fa16dc8dcff491505e987b58dc1d.webm?t=1729869386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254630/extras/72b1fa16dc8dcff491505e987b58dc1d.mp4?t=1729869386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-body control using simple, natural movements\u2014no extra gear required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in organic movement that makes fitness feel like fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick and easy setup with a regular webcam\u2014get started in minutes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine mental strategy with physical movement in this exciting twist on the 2048 puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect mix of gaming and health\u2014you\u2019ll be moving without even realizing it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI-generated songs inspired by 2048 :-)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move independently of the weather, gym schedule, and equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
